# <type>(<scope>): <summary in imperative, max ~50 chars>
#
# English only. Commit messages, PR titles and PR bodies are in English.
# Types: feat | fix | refactor | perf | docs | test | chore | ci | style | revert
# Example:  feat(planner): show remaining credits per requirement
#
# Body (optional): explain WHY, not what. Wrap at ~72 chars.
